Here's the SQL query to achieve this:

```sql
SELECT
    co,
    COUNT(CASE WHEN DATEDIFF('minute', act_dep_time, sched_dep_time) BETWEEN -15 AND 15 THEN 1 END) AS on_time_count
FROM Inst00Z
GROUP BY co;
```

This query will return a table with two columns: 'co' and 'on_time_count'. The 'co' column shows the airline carrier, while the 'on_time_count' column displays the number of on-time arrivals for each carrier.
